---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Contacts — ACTA FRAGILIA" description="Get in touch via email or secure channels.">
  <main class="contacts-page">
    <h1>Contacts</h1>

    <p><strong>We are open to feedback, topic suggestions, fact corrections, and collaboration.</strong></p>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p><a href="mailto:acta_fragilia@proton.me">acta_fragilia@proton.me</a></p>

    <h2>Secure Communication</h2>
    <p>For confidential messages, use Proton Mail (same address) or encrypted channels (upon request).</p>

    <h2>Social Media</h2>
    <p>The project does not maintain accounts on commercial social networks. All publications are only on this website and via RSS.</p>

    <h2>Tips and Investigations</h2>
    <p>If you have information, documents, or a topic for investigation — write to us. Anonymity is guaranteed.</p>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .contacts-page {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .contacts-page h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .contacts-page h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .contacts-page p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .contacts-page a {
    color: #3d5a80;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>